erated change inserted a class at the wrong place, because of course LLMs don’t know that the axioms in a OFN file are conventionally _sorted_ – e.g., the axioms about a CL:7770002 class should appear _before_ the axioms about a CL:7770003 class.)\\r\\n\\r\\ncloses #3332 \",\n  \"comments\": [],\n  \"title\": \"Dont relabel imported annotation properties\",\n  \"url\": \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/pull/3333\"\n}","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"title":"__issue_context__.json","time":{"start":1778975840870,"end":1778975840890}},"id":"prt_e33391807001oBPcAlT6Q0ylFe","sessionID":"ses_1ccc70264ffesYBDox56fXMKAH","messageID":"msg_e333914080012pbc1GT6L4zpfv"}}
